    "title": "A PLANET IN PERIL: THE IMPERATIVE OF ADDRESSING ANTHROPOGENIC CLIMATE CHANGE \u2013 A SYSTEMATIC REVIEW OF CAUSES, IMPACTS, MITIGATION STRATEGIES, AND PUBLIC PERCEPTION",
